---
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#040167] px-4 py-24 md:px-10"
  aria-labelledby="cta-heading"
>
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-full overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute top-[-20%] left-[-10%] h-[50%] w-[50%] rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-20%] right-[-10%] h-[50%] w-[50%] rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 blur-[100px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-[800px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-center">
    <h2
      id="cta-heading"
      class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl"
    >
      ¿Listo para escalar tu infraestructura financiera?
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-[600px] text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-blue-100 md:text-xl">
      Únete a las empresas que están construyendo el futuro del comercio con Supernova Payments.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex w-full flex-col justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href="#get-started"
        class="flex min-w-[200px] cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-3.5 h-14 text-base font-bold text-[#040167] shadow-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-slate-100"
      >
        Crear cuenta
      </a>
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="flex min-w-[200px] cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-[#03004a] px-8 py-3.5 h-14 text-base font-bold text-white transition-all hover:bg-[#03004a]/80"
      >
        Contactar ventas
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
